d3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031462_1383227008937620_6178204217613389819_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SGjUvX0m3FYQ7kNvwHw6TaP&_nc_oc=AdqELYyF5WKdj8I-MWrY7j2weYQ09WX4mrwGEisXi5CQstIZRpoePWh6ozhBNlbY2CY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU6ZF8sWe93YNidQ9Jio9_u3e36Ax4Z2Xhtr1Nw9IwS-Q&oe=6B1049E3"}, "display_name": "Freerunner Championship", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Climb the leaderboard in Freerunner Championship, a competitive VR parkour game that will push your skills to the limit! With heart-pounding action across 5 levels, scale towering walls, navigate treacherous rooftops, and execute death-defying leaps. \n\nRACE TO THE TOP: Compete against global players to clinch the fastest time.\n\nEVERY MOVE COUNTS: From skyscrapers to narrow ledges, precision is paramount. Your route choice and strategy can make or break your record.\n\nURBAN MASTERY: Delve deep into parkour; ascend massive structures, manoeuvre across slim rooftops, evade barriers, and launch into fearless leaps.\n\n5 UNIQUE LEVELS: Traverse diverse settings, from towering rooftops to bustling streets, each offering distinct parkour hurdles.\n\nWith high stakes and higher drops, it's not for the faint-hearted! Are you daring enough to dominate the urban jungle?\n", "short_description": "Climb the leaderboard in Freerunner Championship, a competitive VR parkour game that will push your skills to the limit! With heart-pounding action across 5 levels, scale towering walls, navigate treacherous rooftops, and execute death-defying leaps. With high stakes and higher drops, it's not for the faint-hearted! Are you daring enough to dominate the urban jungle?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/legal/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Maze Theory Limited", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.maze-theory.com/", "ca